      "t": "html",
      "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Initialize <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_10003\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_10003]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00155\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00155</a></span></h3>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">Result</a>&lt; void &gt; Initialize (int &amp;argc, char **argv) noexcept;</pre>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Initialization of the ARA framework. Prior to this call, interaction with the ARA is not allowed with the exception of types intended to be used independently of initialization as defined in <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_15002\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_15002]</a>. It is strongly recommended to make this call in a place where it is guaranteed that static initialization has completed.</p></div>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
